message: "If you use mcpsim in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "mcpsim: millicharged-particle production and sensitivity simulation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bailloeul
    given-names: Leo
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-10"
# doi: (fill after the first archived release)
repository-code: "https://github.com/lbailloeul/mcpsim"
abstract: >-
  Config-driven CLI computing millicharged-particle production (meson decays,
  proton bremsstrahlung, Drell-Yan) and zero-background sensitivity
  projections for fixed-target experiments (DarkQuest/SpinQuest, SHiP,
  LANSCE-mQ, FLAME), with on/off-axis detector geometries and validated
  Python + legacy-C++ decay engines.
